              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"CertificateAuthorityArn\": \"arn:IeCZmQDowHw:o4G4iWjH@@a:2+=:13:s5gSk7N/3ZoMx/ii92U@OHqF/cNSS3\",\n  \"CertificateArn\": \"arn:zrF=:4_/2wLF:c5_v=:3:l7NOL@3K\"\n}",
